{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんです。\nおばんですこんばんは☆\nこの前のブログの質問！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんはショートかロングどっちの髪型がよい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とみなさんに質問したところヽ(・∀・)ﾉ\n圧倒的にショートが生駒ちゃんらしいという感じでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だがしかし、ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ\nロングもやってみたらいいんじゃない？\nという意見もヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そだよね〜\n生駒ちゃん髪の毛長くなったら生駒ちゃんじゃなくなりそうよね〜ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という訳で割と真面目にスタッフさんなどにも相談してみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず！\n肩にかかるくらいまで伸ばそうと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくね☆"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の生駒ちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サキよみジャンBANG!見て頂けましたか？\n生駒ちゃん基本少年漫画大好きで、あとはFree!とかそういう感じのも大好きですが、一番好きなのはナルトなんだ〜ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナルトみたいになりたい。\nナルトの頑張ってる姿に自分を重ねて勇気をもらったり。\n今週のナルトも良い。(〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからテレビでガチな姿を見せてしまいました！\nでも抑えたよ？\n抑えに抑えたよ？\n抑えないときもいからねっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああああああおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおうぎゃゃゃゃゃゃゃゃゃゃゃゃゃゃゃや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/22/2732820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岸本先生のサイン入りTシャツ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもありがたきお言葉を頂きました！\n明日も元気ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々頑張ってるよん(〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあみなさんに質問！\n朝顔洗うときお湯？それとも水？\n生駒ちゃんは水ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ\n目を覚ますの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に私の出身地の由利本荘市で土砂崩れの事故がありました。\n少しでも早く救出活動が進みますように祈っています。"}],"source":"archive"}